|  group by: id
|  row-size=4B cardinality=369 (from HBO)
|
04:EXCHANGE [HASH(id)]
|
03:AGGREGATE [STREAMING]
|  group by: id
|  row-size=4B cardinality=369 (from HBO)
|
00:UNION
|  row-size=4B cardinality=369 (from HBO)
